      "exact_html_sha256": "b5f1b62deae1f3fc852fe72ad6724650e78412fc9dd68be6faa49285ca9df6ff",
      "exact_html": "<div id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1\" class=\"ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem\">\n<h6 class=\"ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem\"><span class=\"ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem\"><span id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.2\" class=\"ltx_text ltx_font_bold\">Theorem 4.1</span></span><span id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.3\" class=\"ltx_text ltx_font_bold\"> </span>(<span id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.4\" class=\"ltx_text ltx_font_bold\">Extension to general <math id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.m1\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\kappa\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mi>κ</mi><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>).</span></h6>\n<div id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.p1\" class=\"ltx_para\">\n<p id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.1\" class=\"ltx_p\"><span id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_text ltx_font_italic\">For every fixed <math id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"\\delta\\in(0,1)\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta\\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists <math id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"d_{0}(\\delta)\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{0}(\\delta)</annotation></semantics></math> such\nthat, for every integer <math id=\"S4.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3\" class=\"ltx_Math\" alttext=\"d\\geq d_{0}(\\delta)\" display=\"inline\" intent=\":literal\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/