      "rendered_text": "Theorem 4.1 ( Extension to general κ \\kappa ). For every fixed δ ∈ ( 0 , 1 ) \\delta\\in(0,1) , there exists d 0 ​ ( δ ) d_{0}(\\delta) such\nthat, for every integer d ≥ d 0 ​ ( δ ) d\\geq d_{0}(\\delta) , 2 ≤ κ ≤ d 1 − δ 2\\leq\\kappa\\leq d^{1-\\delta} , and 0 < ε ≤ 1 / 10 0<\\varepsilon\\leq 1/10 , Q G ​ ( d , κ , ε ) ≥ δ 256 ​ κ ​ log ⁡ d . Q_{G}(d,\\kappa,\\varepsilon)\\geq\\frac{\\delta}{256}\\sqrt{\\kappa}\\log d.",
